OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary teachers hired to teach
OL,4,AGlasgow secondary pupils to read
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimary school teachers have been hired
OL,7,Fto work in Glasgow's high schools to
OL,8,Faddress the growing number of new
OL,9,Fstarts who are unable to read properly.
OL,11,FThe primary teachers run intensive
OL,12,Fcatch-up classes for first-year
OL,13,Fsecondary school pupils without basic
OL,14,Fliteracy skills.
OL,16,FGlasgow's education director, John
OL,17,FMcGhee, said fixing the problem was a
OL,18,F"moral imperative".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
